{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "819e4f53e11f18425cac2a1f31f419020e88c91e172d39e3476f4776492ff642", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ、ジュリアの初ステージだ。\nリハーサル前のジュリアの様子は……）", "zh": "（今天就是茱莉亚首次登台的日子了。\n排练前去看看她的状况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "059337873a5349ac28de5c9dc657ada83d3e51074dc126f3d9d1cb8df209886a", "ja": "ジュリア、落ち着いてるな。やっぱり、\nバンドやストリートで活動した経験の差かな？", "zh": "茱莉亚，你还真是冷静。\n拥有乐团和街头演唱的经验，果然还是有差吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "ddd14e17af7ba53ff00ef7e52da0f9c8303e0e95ca4b8a0cfda04ab8b6771564", "ja": "まあ、な……。ライブはそれなりの本数\nこなしてきたし、今さら緊張なんか……。", "zh": "还好啦……我也上台表演过好几次了，\n怎么可能现在才来紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1004_staff", "source_sha256": "4d62322fa5cdbd70629f072627db25e946a45cff3614fdee5fd9961b78695449", "ja": "ジュリアさん、そろそろリハーサルでーす！\n準備をお願いします！", "zh": "茱莉亚小姐，差不多要开始排练了！\n请做好准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "2ade0f4e565327c07e9d5c1ca11549a6f82d23dfaf66b5758b16dee8cd6310aa", "ja": "はいっ！？　す、すみません……！", "zh": "是！？对、对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "090c00b660eb579356db6ae46ec593abe3842fca5d6c41d9c4184725fd3c8fb9", "ja": "な……なんだよ、その目は！\nあたしが動揺してたら、おかしいのかよ！？", "zh": "你……你那是什么眼神啊！？\n看我这么惊慌，很好笑吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1f9cf304fc7736d82bfda68de81308c56b72d21eef9b27dd157af2eab594f22a", "ja": "いや……。\nちょっと意外だったから、驚いただけだよ。", "zh": "不是……\n我只是有点意外，感到吃惊而已啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "61f4765377eacd6514630c03323780e1689e3ece338268678bcfcea8c229858d", "ja": "し、仕方ないだろ。バンドやストリートでは\n歌ってきたけど、アイドルとしては初めてなんだ。", "zh": "我、我有什么办法？就算以前组团还有在街头\n唱过不少歌，但这是我第一次以偶像身分上场啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "b3548e9f36c39e4e3858e9f5f8fb89c8285d28e55e729df9b8a61520dc61a31e", "ja": "ましてや、ステージでダンスなんて……\n緊張するに決まってるだろ。", "zh": "更别提还要在舞台上跳舞……\n叫我怎么不紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8d587a2bf5b88853cae3e803a87369ee99aca8a654fe39e340702c9ceaf19a86", "ja": "……ははっ。", "zh": "……哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "593a3c353cdfe21ff4aaa3b76db87ffa1a093ff3ef10229edb517ff59c71a999", "ja": "何笑ってんだ！\nくそ……このバカＰ！", "zh": "你笑什么笑！？\n可恶……笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "de35a8f38ea9e3fd5e4430d5a49ae7a37b1f6e3ebd58ac8432e8dc636874d8aa", "ja": "ごめんごめん。でも、ジュリアが\n緊張してるのはよくわかったよ。", "zh": "抱歉、抱歉，不过，\n现在我理解茱莉亚你其实很紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "c9c2d3286f0e8d6078d6fec22e45f8b83a1adafc37e7b469444e41b7e729db87", "ja": "別に、わかってくれってわけじゃ……。", "zh": "我又不是要你理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dd889cfab62d4183bdcaad435dc380cb48c078bcaa7b74bfb6b7c4602266bdcc", "ja": "俺に言えることは……宣材写真の時と同じかな。\n無理に、アイドルらしく振る舞おうとしなくていい。", "zh": "我能给你的建议……就和拍宣传照时一样吧。\n你不用勉强自己装出偶像的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b45d5f5d09c46dc7e1c248eec2b32664a773bfcf792310d311dac590f5ffd0e0", "ja": "思いっきり歌うことだけ考えるんだ。\nジュリアの歌声なら、お客さんもきっと夢中になるよ。", "zh": "只要想着尽情唱歌就行了。\n茱莉亚，你的歌声一定能让观众如痴如醉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "61d35c3898b236948c806d45521c8a0229bb4c018049f34ef62136703c04db7c", "ja": "なんだ、それ……ったく。{$P$}って\n本当にのんきなヤツだよな。", "zh": "什么东西啊……真是的。{$P$}，\n你这家伙真的很悠哉耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f1812101185f86b222cbfc84aa762af6ea04d3c1736af67b80afa69da372c72d", "ja": "そうかな？　でもあの時、ジュリアの歌が、\n確かに俺の足を止めさせたんだ。", "zh": "会吗？不过那个时候，\n就是你的歌声让我驻足的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f5fc50b6a75a346ea59e0fdccb3d8aafcba34647b11b973a8cb637eb6a28a942", "ja": "今日も、聴かせてくれるよな？", "zh": "今天也能唱出一样迷人的歌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ebc3683a84e49e798c3ef1a33e0fde3d25e57b17cd60867da293b6463403afc", "ja": "ふん……当たり前だ。", "zh": "哼……那还用说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "4e69d53b08413f40015d129f7254165f9fe847e7e56596021cde9fef16bf8c48", "ja": "本気のあたしに惚れんなよ？\n{$P$}！", "zh": "可别爱上认真唱歌的我啊！\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7417d82bae8f4aac9f258dc07f1a7b4b582a210030c75e5d728d28c8586d48d5", "ja": "（いい感じに肩の力が抜けたみたいだな。\nこれならきっと、ステージも成功するぞ！）", "zh": "（她的心情似乎平静下来了。\n这样一来，公演肯定也能成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
